Theme engine (bin/nafeel-theme, theme/)
  - theme/templates/builtin: Noctalia's built-in templates and their hook
    scripts (noctalia-dev/noctalia, MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 noctalia-dev).
    The template language, manifest format and the KDE colour-scheme merge
    follow Noctalia's theme engine (src/theme, MIT).
  - Live terminal recolouring (OSC sequences to every pty), `{{ $role }}`
    templates and the user template directory follow caelestia-cli
    (caelestia-dots, GPL-3.0).
  - The core/apps split and the kdeglobals merge follow Ryoku (GPL-3.0).
  - theme/palette/extract.py and pigment.py: moved from the
    wallpaper-palette plugin (see its notes: Caelestia's generator, GPL-3.0).

Wallpaper picker (modules/wallpaper, theme/palette/library.py)
  - The library index, the slice carousel, the mosaic, the colour filter and
    the Wallhaven store (services/Wallhaven.qml) follow ryogami wall-ui in
    Ryoku (Copyright (c) 2026 liixini, MIT).

Dashboard (modules/dashboard), visualiser and lyrics
  - The dashboard's tabs and widgets follow Caelestia's (caelestia-dots/shell,
    GPL-3.0), rebuilt on the shell's own primitives.
  - native/src/caelestia: Caelestia's audio collector, provider, CavaProvider,
    Service and ServiceRef (GPL-3.0), ported into the Nafeel module (one call
    adapted to the newer cavacore API).
  - native/src/cava/cavacore.{c,h}: cava's core (Copyright (c) 2015 Karl
    Stavestrand, MIT; licence in native/src/cava/LICENSE).
  - services/Lyrics.qml follows Caelestia's lyrics service (its lrclib.net
    path), in QML; lyrics come from lrclib.net.
  - native/third_party/m3shapes: soramanew/m3shapes (Apache-2.0; licence in
    that folder), Material 3 Expressive shapes with morphing, a port of
    androidx.graphics.shapes; built as its own M3Shapes QML module.
  - quickshell/assets/bongocat.gif: from Caelestia (GPL-3.0).
